Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轟隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:09.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:15.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:16.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.85,0:00:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它擋在外面！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會讓你傷害任何一個人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:44.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女·天空拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:44.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Hero Girl Sky Punch！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.98,0:00:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色護衛隊又打敗亂暴獸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經是第十隻了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達和暗塌谷帝國 也該吸取教訓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們做得好 英雄們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你們能夠團結 保護好藍天大地的國民
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1245,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}超巨大亂暴獸大爆炸!? 守護藍天大地！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(1320,960)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它本來是性情溫順的野生動物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知為何 突然就開始襲擊村裡人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須要調查一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝 感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這隻動物在什麼時間段出沒？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（動物奔跑聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:29.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,鎮... 鎮靜 求你停下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那隻？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 就是那隻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！你這不懂事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就來幫你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:41.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要出手 隊長！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:44.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,它只是腳受傷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:49.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,它不是危險動物 我來制止它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:52.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了 不要傷害它！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看前面！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（咚）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:09.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就這點程度 一點都不痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.13,0:04:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大功一件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,丟人啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你幫助了村民們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:23.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛隊要負責各式各樣的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與襲擊都城的危險敵人作戰 的確是很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巡邏也是一樣重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在邊境 有非常多的人需要我們幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:38.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我 那個時候的我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 都很嚴厲地警告過這丫頭 不要靠近那座森林的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴你別發呆了 快謝謝人家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:56.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:00.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,幸運的護身符
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能收下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:03.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:13.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:20.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 我便決定要成為英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那種小碎天空石 隨處都可以撿到的 欸嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:25.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(720,965)}Sky Jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能與你像現在這樣重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定也是受到這寶石的指引
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:57.39,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣 公主永永遠遠 幸福地生活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:01.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:04.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 小公主 到午睡的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:05.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要午睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.88,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空 小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 還沒有到叛逆期吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}（敲門聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:21.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 公主殿下！非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鄙人是阿翼的父親...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你們來做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下通知我們的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:44.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 一般都是先回家見父母的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.25,0:06:52.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是騎士 必須陪伴在公主身邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小翼 就沒有脫離叛逆期呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你還把我當孩子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:59.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,先放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被誰看見了 那就太丟臉了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:04.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,有時間嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:10.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 莫非是阿翼的爸爸和媽媽？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:16.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是虹丘真白小姐 我們在那邊世界一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這小子 一段時間沒見 都已經結婚了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:23.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽... 媽媽覺得 小翼你談朋友還為時過早了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了 你們搞錯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你要回天窗市了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:41.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我打算明天和奶奶通話 讓她打開通道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一來我還得上學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.83,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我也看到了 即使我不在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地這裡也沒什麼問題
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.37,0:07:54.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 隊長 護衛隊的隊員們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:58.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還有阿翼 這個世界有你們在保護
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是住在不同的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:05.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,通過通道 隨時可以見面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:08.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有任何改變 也不會失去什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.67,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可是朋友啊 對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:14.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 要保重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:21.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,睡覺的時候 不能露肚皮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:24.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,刷牙漱口要漱乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:28.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不能對阿翼太無理取鬧哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:29.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:34.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不要忘記我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.34,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:42.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好！等晴雯麗巡邏回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起吃一頓大餐吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 真不錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（轟隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:04.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:22.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們認為 我會毫無目的地不斷召喚亂暴獸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:24.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:30.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,被打倒的亂暴獸 它們的能量會潛伏在這都城
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:35.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因為隊長和護衛隊是無法淨化它們的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:43.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 弱者們竭盡全力的努力 全都白費了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:49.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界 是多麼殘酷 是多麼可悲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去城堡裡避難！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.90,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,變得越來越大...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:28.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,國王陛下！那是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是炸彈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:34.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還中意我的禮物嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:37.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是會在一小時後爆炸的炸彈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:41.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,屆時 暗塌谷的黑暗會吞噬藍天大地的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:47.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 你們要是交出小公主的話 我可以中止倒數計時的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:52.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只因我這人心善 給你們一個選擇的餘地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:54.04,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太卑鄙了...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會讓他得逞的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:01.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:02.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他去探查敵情 被攻擊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:07.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,都跟他說過 不能一個人去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:09.20,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:13.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我沒能派上用 嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:17.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.93,0:11:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能用Precure的力量 淨化那顆炸彈嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky和Cure Prism
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們攜手施展的最強招數
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得是叫做...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:32.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,升流耀光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:42.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
